title The line by the goal
intro A part of the field will glow. Then pick its name.
hide names
hide ball

step
  caption Look at the field. One part will glow yellow.

step
  draw goal-line left
  duration 400

question
  prompt What is this line across the end of the field called?
  answer Goal line
  wrong Sideline
  wrong Halfway line
  wrong Center circle
  correct Goal line.
  why The lines at each end are the goal lines. A goal only counts if the ball goes over this line into the net.
